  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融服務創新與數據分析",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL SERVICES INNOVATION AND DATA ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "金融科技係指金融業服務隨著科技發展而創新，本課程將介紹各種金融業創新服務，並搭配金融資料分析以完整了解財務模型與金融科技之結合。此外，本課程針對金融科技力、證券分析師、財務分析師等證照之金融科技考試內容進行授課，有利於學生透過此課程考取相關證照。",
    "describe_eh": "Fintech refers to the innovation of financial services with the development of technology. In this course, you will learn about various innovative services in the financial industry. From analyzing financial data, you will also learn about the collection of financial models and financial technology. Additionally, this course also covers the fintech topics for financial certificates such as fintech, securities analysts, and financial analysts.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
