    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<ol>\n\t<li>\u001fDixon, M. F.,&nbsp; Halperin, I., \u001fBilokon, P. (2020). <em><strong>Machine Learning in Finance:&nbsp;From Theory to Practice</strong></em>.&nbsp;Springer.&nbsp;ISBN: 9783030410681</li>\n\t<li>McNelis, P. D. (2005). <em><strong>Neural Networks in Finance: Gaining Predictive Edge in the Market</strong></em>.&nbsp;Elsevier. ISBN:&nbsp;9780124859678</li>\n\t<li>Greene, W. H. (2012). <em><strong>Econometric Analysis</strong></em>.&nbsp;Pearson.&nbsp;ISBN: 9780273753568</li>\n\t<li>Chishti, S., Barberis, J. (2016). <em><strong>The FINTECH Book: The Financial Technology Handbook for Investors, Entrepreneurs and Visionaries</strong></em>. Wiley.&nbsp;ISBN: 978-1119218876</li>\n\t<li>李顯正。(2021)。<strong><em>金融科技概論</em></strong>。新陸書局。ISBN: 978-9860627251</li>\n\t<li>台灣金融研訓院編輯委員會。(2020)。<em><strong>金融科技力</strong></em>。台灣金融研訓院。ISBN:&nbsp;978-9863992103</li>\n\t<li>Peng, R. D., Kross, S., Anderson, B. (2020).&nbsp;<strong><em>Mastering Software Development in R</em></strong>.&nbsp;Available at: &nbsp;<a href=\"https://bookdown.org/rdpeng/RProgDA/\" target=\"_blank\">https://bookdown.org/rdpeng/RProgDA/</a></li>\n</ol>\n",
